{"2832220": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Theme Park Architect", "steam_appid": 2832220, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Park Studio is becoming <strong>Theme Park Architect</strong>, some game logos are still being updated.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832220/extras/9f187094368a11304d3d5a857993dfcf.avif?t=1784193538\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832220/extras_big/9f187094368a11304d3d5a857993dfcf.avif?t=1784193538 width=1560 height=780 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Have you ever wanted to build the theme park of your dreams? Now you can!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Theme Park Architect is the next generation of theme park simulation in the making! Experience true creative freedom with no virtual limitations as you create the ultimate theme park at scales you never even considered before!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With clever and unique tools built for speed and performance, you can stop worrying about piece counts or tedious work and focus on realizing your vision!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jump in and make something Creative!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832220/extras/e92cfe72a1447c73dd2d5429fb6f464a.avif?t=1784193538\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832220/extras_big/e92cfe72a1447c73dd2d5429fb6f464a.webp?t=1784193538 width=1560 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A great park starts with great rides. Whether your vision includes thrilling hyper coasters or carefully crafted ride experiences, Theme Park Architect gives you the tools to build precisely what you imagined!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832220/extras/bcfffa97329786649f6f3da6dfebf8bb.poster.avif?t=1784193538\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832220/extras/bcfffa97329786649f6f3da6dfebf8bb.webm?t=1784193538\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832220/extras/bcfffa97329786649f6f3da6dfebf8bb.mp4?t=1784193538\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape every twist and turn, drops and launches using the simple node-based coaster builder, or go a step above with the <strong>Force Vector Design</strong> editor to build coasters like a pro! Got a layout ready from another software? Bring it in your park with the one-click <strong>CSV Importer</strong>, and get working coaster in minutes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push the ride experience a step further with <strong>Special Track Elements</strong> such as <strong>switch tracks</strong>, <strong>turn tables</strong> and more, available on every coaster model with no restrictions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832220/extras/3f26be6fb2b0ad3f713a91f96fe75dcc.poster.avif?t=1784193538\" width=1170 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832220/extras/3f26be6fb2b0ad3f713a91f96fe75dcc.webm?t=1784193538\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832220/extras/3f26be6fb2b0ad3f713a91f96fe75dcc.mp4?t=1784193538\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832220/extras/7e5e4961a6c9d9d81e7f2c998596c591.avif?t=1784193538\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832220/extras_big/7e5e4961a6c9d9d81e7f2c998596c591.webp?t=1784193538 width=1560 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scenery completes the look of your park, and Theme Park Architect comes with everything you need to design the most detailed and amazing theming you've ever seen! From the shape of the land to the smallest details of your ride decors, you have all the tools you need to realize your vision!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832220/extras/cd76e6ffa86cf904e850d858b920c926.poster.avif?t=1784193538\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832220/extras/cd76e6ffa86cf904e850d858b920c926.webm?t=1784193538\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832220/extras/cd76e6ffa86cf904e850d858b920c926.mp4?t=1784193538\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct the buildings that bring your park to life using the wide library of thousands of pieces, including <strong>7 unique themes</strong> to pick and choose from! Shape terrain with precision and unique tools such as <strong>stamps</strong> and <strong>scenery painting</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build paths, fences, plazas or even <strong>rivers</strong> and <strong>lakes</strong> with the <strong>Spline Tools</strong>, a unique set of tools that cut the tedious work of manually placing large amounts of repeating pieces!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize ride signs with the <strong>Text</strong> and <strong>SVG</strong> tools, allowing you to type with any font on your machine or import your very own SVG logos straight into the game without needing to use a hundred art shapes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832220/extras/48152ae84e579abf80b66552d934c87b.poster.avif?t=1784193538\" width=1170 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832220/extras/48152ae84e579abf80b66552d934c87b.webm?t=1784193538\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832220/extras/48152ae84e579abf80b66552d934c87b.mp4?t=1784193538\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832220/extras/a8c4e12c0bd26665d4fff6b44eaddcfa.avif?t=1784193538\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832220/extras_big/a8c4e12c0bd26665d4fff6b44eaddcfa.webp?t=1784193538 width=1560 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Share the creativity!</strong> Using the Steam Workshop you can help other Creatives, share your amazing creations and download other's creations to discover new and unique creative ways to build within the game! Or, if you're not a builder, you can easily still play the way you want and use other's creative work to bring your dream park to life!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832220/extras/dc3481bb860322f7f8ddf44a0d508e3a.avif?t=1784193538\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832220/extras_big/dc3481bb860322f7f8ddf44a0d508e3a.webp?t=1784193538 width=1560 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Theme Park Architect is in active development, with new features and major content updates coming! <strong>Join the community on Discord</strong> to help shape what's next! Your suggestions and feedback are very important to make Theme Park Architect the ultimate theme park simulation game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832220/extras/587aa3f4810977ea2d295aa2f8afa633.avif?t=1784193538\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832220/extras_big/587aa3f4810977ea2d295aa2f8afa633.avif?t=1784193538 width=1560 height=448 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Park Studio is becoming <strong>Theme Park Architect</strong>, some game logos are still being updated.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832220/extras/9f187094368a11304d3d5a857993dfcf.avif?t=1784193538\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832220/extras_big/9f187094368a11304d3d5a857993dfcf.avif?t=1784193538 width=1560 height=780 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Have you ever wanted to build the theme park of your dreams? Now you can!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Theme Park Architect is the next generation of theme park simulation in the making! Experience true creative freedom with no virtual limitations as you create the ultimate theme park at scales you never even considered before!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With clever and unique tools built for speed and performance, you can stop worrying about piece counts or tedious work and focus on realizing your vision!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jump in and make something Creative!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832220/extras/e92cfe72a1447c73dd2d5429fb6f464a.avif?t=1784193538\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832220/extras_big/e92cfe72a1447c73dd2d5429fb6f464a.webp?t=1784193538 width=1560 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A great park starts with great rides. Whether your vision includes thrilling hyper coasters or carefully crafted ride experiences, Theme Park Architect gives you the tools to build precisely what you imagined!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832220/extras/bcfffa97329786649f6f3da6dfebf8bb.poster.avif?t=1784193538\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832220/extras/bcfffa97329786649f6f3da6dfebf8bb.webm?t=1784193538\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832220/extras/bcfffa97329786649f6f3da6dfebf8bb.mp4?t=1784193538\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape every twist and turn, drops and launches using the simple node-based coaster builder, or go a step above with the <strong>Force Vector Design</strong> editor to build coasters like a pro! Got a layout ready from another software? Bring it in your park with the one-click <strong>CSV Importer</strong>, and get working coaster in minutes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push the ride experience a step further with <strong>Special Track Elements</strong> such as <strong>switch tracks</strong>, <strong>turn tables</strong> and more, available on every coaster model with no restrictions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832220/extras/3f26be6fb2b0ad3f713a91f96fe75dcc.poster.avif?t=1784193538\" width=1170 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832220/extras/3f26be6fb2b0ad3f713a91f96fe75dcc.webm?t=1784193538\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832220/extras/3f26be6fb2b0ad3f713a91f96fe75dcc.mp4?t=1784193538\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832220/extras/7e5e4961a6c9d9d81e7f2c998596c591.avif?t=1784193538\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832220/extras_big/7e5e4961a6c9d9d81e7f2c998596c591.webp?t=1784193538 width=1560 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scenery completes the look of your park, and Theme Park Architect comes with everything you need to design the most detailed and amazing theming you've ever seen! From the shape of the land to the smallest details of your ride decors, you have all the tools you need to realize your vision!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinli